# What joybox itself uses; pyproject.toml reads its dependencies from here.
# Compile the lock after editing:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras -o requirements.txt requirements.in
#
# Every one of these is imported inside the function that needs it, so
# bootstrap.py still runs on a bare system python on day 0. lxml is the parser
# BeautifulSoup is asked for, and mutagen is loaded by name. The machine's own
# wishlist of venv tools is in Shared/joybox/bootstrap/packages/python.py.
anthropic
beautifulsoup4
# rclone's obscuring of the passwords it is handed
cryptography
html-text
libWiiPy
lxml
# Reads classic Mac HFS volumes for isoextract -f HFS
machfs
mergedeep
mutagen
paramiko
pillow
psutil
PyGithub
python-dateutil
python-magic
PyYAML
pyuac; sys_platform == 'win32'
pywinpty; sys_platform == 'win32'
requests
schedule
screeninfo
selenium
thefuzz
tqdm
Unidecode
vdf
webdriver-manager
xmltodict
xxhash
